# Example depth-dependent RSF parameters for the megathrust group,
# loosely following the logic of the temperature-dependent a-b
# stability arguments (gabbro-type fits mapped through a subduction
# geotherm, cf. Becker, Tectonic Geodynamics, Fig. 3.49b): velocity
# strengthening near the surface, a weakening seismogenic core, and a
# return to strengthening downdip. These are ILLUSTRATIVE control
# points for one warm-ish geotherm choice, not fits; edit freely, or
# regenerate from an actual T(z) profile and lab a-b(T) data. Linear
# interpolation between control points; end values extend beyond.
# depth_km   a       b
0.0   0.015  0.011
5.0   0.015  0.011
8.0   0.010  0.014
30.0  0.010  0.014
42.0  0.016  0.010
60.0  0.020  0.010
